!!! Table-like objects

* ``nyaos.alias``
* ``nyaos.option``
* ``nyaos.suffix``
* ``nyaos.folder``
* ``nyaos.argv`` 

``nyaos.``''XXXXX'' is the interface of ''XXXXX'.

8<
lua_e "
    nyaos.alias['cp'] = 'cmd /c copy'
    print('cp='..nyaos.alias['cp'])
    for key,val in pairs(nyaos.alias) do
        print(key..'='..val)
    end
"
>8

